name tokenizers
witness Model tokenizers
class UserCuratedResource
# The tokenizers of the models kept on this machine (Hugging Face tokenizer.json): each a JSON document, ordinary
# content recorded as its syntax tree, byte for byte; its model's vocab is the members that name each token and give
# its number, in the tokenizer's order. It attests nothing.
files $LAPLACE_MODELS/*/tokenizer.json
# a model kept as the Hugging Face hub caches it: models--ORG--NAME/snapshots/REVISION/tokenizer.json
files $LAPLACE_MODELS/models--*/snapshots/*/tokenizer.json
room 16
after unicode
reads json
